{
  "_README": [
    "Opcodes with NO vector in conformance/corpus. Nothing verifies their wire",
    "shape: round-trip tests are self-consistent by construction, and mock-server",
    "tests are built from these same SDK types, so all three agree with each other",
    "and none of them agrees with anything external.",
    "",
    "This file exists so the gap is a tracked, shrinking list rather than an",
    "invisible one. Each SDK asserts that every opcode it declares is either",
    "covered by the corpus or named here -- so a new verb cannot land unnoticed.",
    "",
    "To remove an entry: add the case upstream in brain",
    "(crates/brain-protocol/tests/conformance.rs), re-bless with",
    "BRAIN_CONFORMANCE_BLESS=1, re-vendor the corpus, and delete the name here.",
    "",
    "A QueryRequest field (session_filter) was missing from all three SDKs for",
    "exactly this reason -- QUERY_EXPLAIN / QUERY_TRACE are on this list."
  ],
